OL,5,G1200 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FKevin has a rare condition called
OL,7,     Fsyringomyelia, something he will
OL,8,     Fnot recover from. Osman has been
OL,9,     Fin a car accident, but Ramadan
OL,10,     Fmeans he can't take painkillers.
OL,11,G1300 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,12,     FTazamal is used to the effects of
OL,13,     Fhis schizophrenia, but now he has
OL,14,     Fnausea too. Anthony discovered a
OL,15,     Flump in his throat a few months
OL,16,     Fago, and now he is coughing up
OL,17,     Fblood.
